      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡No puedo creer que hayas conseguido ahuyentar\na esos Beldum! ¡Muchas gracias!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahora, por fin podremos volver a usarlo...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068006F00720061002C00200070006F0072002000660069006E00200070006F006400720065006D006F007300200076006F006C0076006500720020006100200075007300610072006C006F002E002E002E00100002011401590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Eh?! ¡¿Han vuelto?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF00450068003F0021002000A100BF00480061006E0020007600750065006C0074006F003F002100100002011401590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Arg... ¿Por qué siempre me pasa todo a mí?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100720067002E002E002E002000BF0050006F007200200071007500E90020007300690065006D0070007200650020006D00650020007000610073006100200074006F0064006F002000610020006D00ED003F00100002011401590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Ocurre algo, Imanol?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004F0063007500720072006500200061006C0067006F002C00200049006D0061006E006F006C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ah, patrón! B-bueno, mírelo usted...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100410068002C0020007000610074007200F3006E002100200042002D006200750065006E006F002C0020006D00ED00720065006C006F002000750073007400650064002E002E002E00100002011401590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Caray con esos Beldum! Mira qué bien están\nahí acurrucaditos.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006100720061007900200063006F006E002000650073006F0073002000420065006C00640075006D00210020004D00690072006100200071007500E90020006200690065006E002000650073007400E1006E000A0061006800ED002000610063007500720072007500630061006400690074006F0073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los Beldum están hechos de imanes y se pirran\npor las ondas electromagnéticas que generan<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nlos Holotransportadores. En otras palabras...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Buen trabajo, Imanol. Esto prueba claramente que\nel Holotransportador vuelve a funcionar a pleno<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nrendimiento. En fin, me vuelvo a mi puesto.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que les atrae el Holotransportador que\nacabo de reparar...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007300ED00200071007500650020006C0065007300200061007400720061006500200065006C00200048006F006C006F007400720061006E00730070006F0072007400610064006F00720020007100750065000A0061006300610062006F00200064006500200072006500700061007200610072002E002E002E00100002011401590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Beeel!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10042006500650065006C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahora que lo pienso, si los tuviera conmigo,\nsabría enseguida si están escacharrados.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡No se hable más! ¡Me los quedo a todos\ncomo compañeros!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004E006F0020007300650020006800610062006C00650020006D00E100730021002000A1004D00650020006C006F007300200071007500650064006F0020006100200074006F0064006F0073000A0063006F006D006F00200063006F006D0070006100F100650072006F0073002100100002011401590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Buf... Ya los he atrapado a todos. ¡Es el inicio\nde una bonita amistad!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Mira, mis Beldum han evolucionado a Metang!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMe ayudan un montón en el curro. ¡Ya no sé\nqué haría sin mis compis!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 121
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Mira, mira! ¡Mis Beldum han evolucionado\na Metagross!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCon lo grandotes que se han vuelto, y siguen\nobsesionados con los Holotransportadores.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
